{"articleNo":"1643","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1643&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"승용차 5부제 강화 시행 및 위반차량 단속 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.03.08","hit":"10216","attachments":[{"name":"선택요일제 스티커 발급 신청서(교직원용)1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1643&attachNo=71032"},{"name":"선택요일제 스티커 발급 신청서(학생용)1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1643&attachNo=71274"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"바탕글\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">승용차 5부제 강화 시행 및 위반차량 단속 알림<br></span><br><font face=\"굴림\">에너지 위기 <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">“주의경보”발령에 따라 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">범국가적 에너지절약 분위기 조성 및 성과</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">제고를 위하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">승용</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">차 5부제 위반차량 단속을 실시하오니 요일제스티커를 부착(미부착 시 끝번호 요일제 적용)하여 선택 또는 끝번호 요일제를 준수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 점검일시 : 2011. 3. 9.(수) ~ 3. 10.(목)/매주 불시 점검</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. 점검내용 : 위반차량 단속 및 조치<br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">선택요일제 스티커 부착 차량은 해당 요일, 미 부착 시 끝번호 요일제 적용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><br><br>다. 선택요일제 신규 및 재발급 신청 :&nbsp;첨부파일을 작성하여&nbsp;해당부서 제출<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학생 : 학사서비스센터(학생회관 1층)<br>&nbsp; - 교직원 :&nbsp;사무국 총무팀(본관 502호)<br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 끝번호 요일제에 따라 운행하는 차량은 선택요일제 신청 불요<br><br><strong><em>&lt;제외차량&gt;<br></em></strong><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">｢공공기관 에너지이용 합리화 추진지침(국무총리 지시, ’08.6.12)｣</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"> 제29조 제①항의 규정에 의한 차량</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">경차, 장애인사용 승용차(국가유공자 자동차표지 부착차량 포함), 긴급 자동차,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">보도용 자동차, 외교용 자동차, 군용 자동차, 경호용 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">자동차, 화물 자동차, 특수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"> 자동차, 승합 자동차, 하이브리드 자동차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">, 임산부 및 유아 동승차량</span></p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">- 에너지절약추진위원회에서 심의‧승인한 차량<br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">원거리(시외 또는 대중교통 이용 불가 지역) 출․퇴근 차량, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">상시 현장출장 차량, 상시 조기출근자(07시 이전) 차량, 2～3교대 근무자 차량, 연구수행 교직원 차량, 환자탑승 차량, 안전시설 검사 차량</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><br><!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"></p>\n<p></p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<p></p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<p></p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<p></p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
